30 days\",\"boohooMetric1Body\":\"Security team hours per month saved on manual email tasks\",\"boohooMetric2Body\":\"Total employee hours saved on graymail and spam in 90 days\",\"adtMetric1Body\":\"Phishing attacks prevented by Abnormal\",\"adtMetric2Body\":\"Account Takeover/Fraud attacks prevented by Abnormal\",\"ingersollRandMetric1Body\":\"per year saved with AI SOC automation\",\"ingersollRandMetric2Body\":\"employee \u0026 VIP hours saved on graymail in 30 days\",\"taylorMadeMetric1Body\":\"reduction in account takeover attacks\",\"taylorMadeMetric2Body\":\"analyst hours saved by AI Security Mailbox each quarter\"},\"ceoPerspectives\":{\"eyebrow\":\"About Abnormal\",\"title\":\"An AI Company Dedicated to Cybersecurity From Day One\",\"subhead\":\"Built by AI insiders with an outsider’s perspective:\\nBehavioral AI is the future of defense.\",\"summary\":\"Our mission is to stop crime with AI and bring cybersecurity from the future to defenders today. In a future where every attack is novel, you need to understand the normal behavior of an organization to detect Abnormal.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Learn More About Us\",\"videoTitle\":\"The Future of AI Is Exponential — CEO Perspectives\",\"imageAlt\":\"The Future of AI Is Exponential — CEO Perspectives\",\"playLabel\":\"Play video\",\"videoCaptionTitle\":\"The Future Is Exponential\",\"videoCaptionSubhead\":\"Hear from CEO Evan Reiser on how AI is reshaping the threat landscape — and why Abnormal is built for what’s next.\"},\"attuneBenchmark\":{\"panel1Title\":\"Detects more attacks\",\"panel1Meta\":\"Higher is better\",\"panel1Mult\":\"46×\",\"panel1MultLabel\":\"fewer misses\",\"panel1Desc\":\"Percentage share of human-confirmed true-positive attacks.\",\"panel2Title\":\"Delivers fewer false positives\",\"panel2Meta\":\"Higher is better\",\"panel2Mult\":\"60×\",\"panel2MultLabel\":\"fewer FPs\",\"panel2Desc\":\"Out of attacks detected, what percentage are real attacks and not false positives?\",\"panel3Title\":\"Op