that matter.\",\"body\":\"Abnormal plugs into the tools your teams already use, giving you visibility and security across email, identity, cloud and more without adding complexity.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"See All Integrations\",\"ctaHref\":\"/platform/technology-integrations\"},\"stats\":{\"headline\":\"The Value of Behavioral AI Is Unmatched\",\"vendorFraudPrevented\":\"in vendor fraud prevented all time\",\"vendorFraudPrefix\":\"$$\",\"vendorFraudSuffix\":\"B\",\"roiThreeYear\":\"ROI over 3-years\",\"recommendAbnormal\":\"of customers would recommend Abnormal\"},\"finalCta\":{\"headline\":\"See Behavioral AI Stop What Others Miss\",\"body\":\"In a 30-minute demo, we’ll walk you through real attacks blocked in environments like yours, including BEC, account takeover, credential phishing, and more. No setup required.\",\"buttonText\":\"Request a Demo\"}},\"whyAbnormalPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Cloud Email Security - Block Malicious Email Attacks | Abnormal AI\",\"description\":\"Protect your organization from email attacks with Abnormal AI. Our behavioral AI platform stops phishing, social engineering, and account takeovers.\"},\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Why Abnormal\",\"headline\":\"The Future of Cybersecurity Is Abnormal\",\"body\":\"Abnormal AI turns normal behavior into the defender's advantage.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\"},\"whyAbnormalVideo\":{\"headline\":\"Abnormal Was Built for the AI Era of Attacks\",\"body\":\"Hear Founder and CEO Evan Reiser on why Abnormal built an AI-native platform for the attacks no one has seen yet.\",\"iframeTitle\":\"Why Abnormal — Platform Overview\"},\"industryRecognition\":{\"heading\":\"Industry Recognition\"},\"imageAlts\":{\"understands\":\"Illustration symbolizing Abnormal's behavioral AI understanding human identity and communication patterns.\",\"customerCentric\":\"Illustration symbolizing Abnormal's customer-centric platform focus and deep customer relationships.\",\"autopilot\":\"Illustration symbolizing autonomous, automated email security and AI-driven remediation.\",\"vision\":\"Illustration symbolizing Abnormal's long-term platform vision and future-ready commitment to customers.\",\"innovative\":\"Illustration symbolizing Abnormal as the most innovative company in cybersecurity, with industry-leading R\u0026D.\",\"fastTimeToValue\":\"Illustration symbolizing Abnormal's API-first deployment delivering fast time-to-value.\",\"trusted\":\"Illustration symbolizing Abnormal's trusted security, privacy, and compliance posture.\",\"marketLeadership\":\"Illustration symbolizing Abnormal's recognized market leadership in AI-driven cybersecurity.\"},\"unique\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Why Abnormal Is Unique\",\"headline\":\"No One Understands What's Normal Like Abnormal\",\"body\":\"5,000 organizations trust Abnormal. Here's what makes us different.\",\"cards\":{\"understands\":{\"title\":\"Understands the Behavior Behind the Risk\",\"body\":\"Abnormal connects the behavior of people, AI agents, applications, and cloud identities to learn what is normal and detect the deviations that signal risk.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Uncover Our Platform\",\"ctaHref\":\"/platform/overview\"},\"autopilot\":{\"title\":\"Security on Autopilot\",\"body\":\"Most tools raise an alert and hand you the work. Abnormal can be configured to investigate, decide, and remediate on its own, so your team avoids manual work to focus on critical tasks.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Discover Accelerated AI Automation\",\"ctaHref\":\"/solutions/automate-soc-operations\"},\"vision\":{\"title\":\"Protection in Days, Not Quarters\",\"body\":\"As your risks evolve, Abnormal extends behavioral AI across email, identity, and AI security. Explore available products and work with us through design-partner and priority-customer programs as new capabilities develop.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Learn More About Us\",\"ctaHref\":\"/about\"},\"innovative\":{\"title\":\"Built for the AI Era, by Design\",\"body\":\"Abnormal isn't a legacy product with AI bolted on. It was architected from day one for a world where attackers have AI too.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Learn Who We Are\",\"ctaHref\":\"/about/what-customers-believe\"},\"fastTimeToValue\":{\"title\":\"A Data Advantage Built Over Eight Years\",\"body\":\"A foundational AI model built for security, trained on eight years of proprietary behavioral data — and every new attack makes it sharper. It's a lead that widens, not one that is easy to close.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Learn More About Our Behavioral AI Model\",\"ctaHref\":\"/platform/attune\"},\"trusted\":{\"title\":\"Your Partner for the AI Era\",\"body\":\"The AI era demands results today and readiness for tomorrow. Abnormal delivers both — stopping the attacks that may get past others now, and building the defenses for the threats you'll face next.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"See Why We’re Different\",\"ctaHref\":\"/about\"},\"marketLeadership\":{\"title\":\"The Choice of the World’s Most Demanding Security Teams\",\"body\":\"The most sophisticated security teams in the world choose Abnormal—5,000 of them, 99% who'd recommend it—and hold it to the standards they set.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"See Our Customers\",\"ctaHref\":\"/customers/stories\"}}}},\"about\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"THIS IS ABNORMAL\",\"headline\":\"An AI Company Dedicated to Cybersecurity.\",\"body\":\"Built by AI insiders with an outsider’s perspective: Behavior is the future of cyber defense.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Our Mission\",\"ctaSecondary\":\"Explore Careers\",\"imagePlaceholder\":\"Hero Image / About Visual\"},\"blades\":{\"discoverMore\":\"Discover More\",\"founders\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Where We Came From\",\"title\":\"Founded by AI Insiders and Cyber Outsiders\",\"body1\":\"Beginning in 2010, our founders spent years in adtech — building AI that analyzed massive datasets, learned human behavior, and made anomaly-based decisions in milliseconds.\",\"body2\":\"When they turned to cybersecurity, they saw what its insiders had missed: the AI that models behavior can stop the attacks that exploit it. In 2018, they founded Abnormal to stop crime with AI.\",\"imageUrl\":\"/images/about/how-we-got-here.png\",\"href\":\"/about/how-we-got-here\"},\"whatWeDo\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Our Impact\",\"title\":\"We Protect Millions of People and More Than 30% of the Fortune 500.\",\"body1\":\"Millions of attacks stopped. Thousands of analyst hours saved. Billions in financial losses prevented.\",\"imageUrl\":\"/images/about/what-we-do.png\",\"href\":\"/platform/overview\"},\"whatWeAre\":{\"eyebrow\":\"What We Are\",\"title\":\"AI-Native in Practice, Not Just in Name\",\"body1\":\"We don't just build AI products — we're an AI-native company. Every team at Abnormal, from Product to CS to Finance, runs with AI agents. That operational advantage compounds into faster innovation and better outcomes for our customers.\",\"cta\":\"See Us Transform with AI\",\"imageUrl\":\"/images/about/what-we-are.png\",\"href\":\"/transform\"},\"whoWeAre\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Who We Are\",\"title\":\"A Pioneering Team of Humans and AI Agents\",\"body1\":\"Evan Reiser founded Abnormal on a simple belief: AI that understands normal human behavior is a powerful defense against the attacks that exploit it. Today, that belief runs through everything we do — a team of AI and cybersecurity experts, working alongside AI agents, united by a single mission: stopping the attacks that target people. It's a new kind of team, built for a new kind of threat.\",\"cta\":\"Meet Our Leadership\",\"imageUrl\":\"/images/about/who-we-are.png\",\"href\":\"/about/team\"},\"trustedAi\":{\"eyebrow\":\"What We Believe\",\"title\":\"The Behavioral AI Enterprises Trust\",\"body1\":\"We move fast because the threat doesn't wait. We own outcomes — for our customers and for each other. We say what's true, even when it's uncomfortable. We measure ourselves by customer results, not internal metrics. And we hold ourselves to a standard the rest of the industry hasn't caught up to yet. That's not a philosophy. That's how we operate every day.\",\"imageUrl\":\"/images/about/what-customers-believe.png\",\"href\":\"/about/what-customers-believe\"},\"autonomous\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Who We Protect\",\"title\":\"The Standard for the World's Most Trusted Organizations\",\"body1\":\"More than 30% of the Fortune 500 trust Abnormal with their highly sensitive data and the authority to act on it. That's not a passive relationship. These organizations don't just use Abnormal to flag threats — they give it the access and configure it with the autonomy to make business-critical security decisions on its own. When the world's leading enterprises need security they can trust, they choose Abnormal.\",\"imageUrl\":\"/images/about/where-we-are-going.png\",\"href\":\"/about/where-we-are-going\"},\"unconventional\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Where We Are Going\",\"title\":\"The Future of Cybersecurity Looks Nothing Like Today\",\"body1\":\"We're building toward a world that the industry isn't ready for yet. Here's what we know to be true:\",\"body2\":\"The cybercrime AI is about to unleash will dwarf anything the world has seen.\\nSecurity investment is wildly misaligned with security risk.\\nThe industry has normalized failure. We haven't.\\nCustomers hold security vendors to unacceptably low standards — and vendors have gotten comfortable with that.\\nAI should do a significant amount, freeing humans for strategy and judgment.\",\"body3\":\"The world needs a new approach to cybersecurity in the AI era. The world needs Abnormal.\",\"imageUrl\":\"/images/about/what-we-believe.png\",\"href\":\"/why-abnormal\"}},\"closingCta\":{\"headline\":\"See What Your Gateway Is Missing\",\"body\":\"Deploy in 60 seconds via API. No MX changes. Start catching the attacks that cost the most.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\",\"ctaSecondary\":{\"label\":\"Explore Careers\",\"href\":\"/careers\"}},\"howWeGotHere\":{\"storyBlades\":{\"blade1\":{\"title\":\"Recognized a New Paradigm Required to Protect Humans\",\"description\":\"Conventional cybersecurity approaches used to protect infrastructure from known attacks were ineffective in protecting humans from socially-engineered, never-before-seen attacks. We knew there had to be a better way.\"},\"blade2\":{\"title\":\"Realized the Power of Behavioral AI to Uniquely Protect Humans\",\"description\":\"We strongly believed that behavioral AI was the answer. With its distinctive ability to make millions of contextual judgements about human behavior in milliseconds, we realized its power in detecting anomalies and autonomously stopping attacks.\"},\"blade3\":{\"title\":\"Founded as an AI-Native Company\",\"description\":\"Abnormal was founded as the first AI-native cybersecurity company. The Abnormal Behavior Platform was architected with AI from the beginning—leveraging machine learning natively to ensure higher accuracy, faster speeds, and greater efficiency compared to AI add-ons or retrofitted products.\"}},\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"How We Got Here\",\"headline\":\"Founded by AI Insiders and Cyber Outsiders\",\"body\":\"In 2010, the founders leveraged AI's ability to make billions of real-time decisions in AdTech—building a successful AI company that was acquired by Twitter/X. In 2018, they founded Abnormal to apply their AI learnings to a greater mission: protecting humans from cybercrime.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\",\"ctaSecondary\":\"Explore the Platform\"},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"See the Platform Built AI-Native from Day One\",\"body\":\"Get a personalized look at how Abnormal's behavioral AI protects your people, platforms, and business.\",\"label\":\"Request a Demo\"}}},\"aboutOurMission\":{\"hero\":{\"headline\":\"Stop Cybercrime with AI\",\"body\":\"Our mission is to stop cybercrime with AI. We use behavioral AI to protect organizations across email, identity, and AI, helping customers defend against sophisticated attacks and adopt AI securely.\"},\"intro\":\"GenAI has given attackers greater speed, scale, and sophistication than ever before. This landscape pushes Abnormal to work tirelessly on our mission of delivering secure outcomes for our customers.\",\"chapters\":{\"civilization\":{\"label\":\"Protecting Civilization\",\"headline\":\"The Systems Modern Society Depends on are Under Attack\",\"body\":\"Financial markets, healthcare networks, energy grids, government infrastructure all run on human communication. AI has collapsed the cost of sophisticated attacks to near zero while the cost of a successful one keeps climbing. Protecting civilization means defending the communication layer every critical system depends on.\"},\"organizations\":{\"label\":\"Protecting Global Organizations\",\"headline\":\"Every Organization is a Network of Human Decisions\",\"body\":\"When an attacker compromises one person inside an enterprise, they gain the ability to move laterally, escalate access, and cause damage far beyond a single inbox. Traditional security watches for known signatures. The attacks that cause the most damage today exploit trust between people, including a vendor relationship, a reporting chain, a routine financial process.\"},\"humans\":{\"label\":\"Protecting Humans\",\"headline\":\"Every Attack Ends with a Person\",\"body\":\"A CFO wiring funds to a fraudulent account. An employee clicking a link from what appears to be their CEO. These are not careless people. They are professionals trusting the systems they depend on. Protecting humans means building systems that understand behavior deeply enough to recognize when something is wrong, before the person has any reason to suspect it.\"}},\"reinforcement\":{\"stat\":\"organizations trust Abnormal to protect\\nthe people behind their most critical operations.\",\"eyebrow\":\"The Mission in Practice\",\"body\":\"Cybercrime will continue to evolve. The attacks of tomorrow will be more sophisticated, more personalized, and harder to detect than anything we face today. But the mission does not change: stop cybercrime with AI.\"},\"closingCta\":{\"headline\":\"See What Abnormal Sees\",\"body\":\"Get a personalized demo and uncover threats hiding in your environment today.\",\"buttonText\":\"Request a Demo\"}},\"aboutTeam\":{\"hero\":{\"headline\":\"Abnormal Leadership\",\"body\":\"Built by operators and engineers with deep expertise in AI, cybersecurity, and enterprise software — from Google, Twitter, Amazon, and the companies defining the next generation of security.\"},\"boardHeading\":\"Board Members and Advisors\",\"investorsHeading\":\"Investors\",\"roles\":{\"boardMember\":\"Board Member\",\"advisor\":\"Advisor\"},\"leadership\":{\"evan-reiser\":\"Founder \u0026 CEO\",\"sanjay-jeyakumar\":\"Co-Founder\",\"abhi-bagri\":\"Chief Technology Officer\",\"lisa-banks\":\"Chief Financial Officer\",\"kevin-moore\":\"Chief Revenue Officer\",\"mike-britton\":\"Chief Information Officer\",\"john-slavitt\":\"Chief Legal Officer\",\"lisa-wallace\":\"Chief People \u0026 Transformation Officer\",\"jake-yount\":\"SVP of Global Enterprise Sales\",\"kevin-wang\":\"SVP of Engineering\",\"noah-rolff\":\"VP of Customer Success\",\"keith-mokris\":\"VP of Product and Content Marketing\",\"ryan-patel-francis\":\"VP of Revenue Marketing\",\"stephen-harrison\":\"VP of Product, New Products\"},\"closingCta\":{\"headline\":\"See What Abnormal Sees\",\"body\":\"Get a personalized demo and uncover threats hiding in your environment today.\",\"buttonText\":\"Request a Demo\"}},\"aboutTeamProfile\":{\"backLink\":\"Leadership\",\"backToLeadership\":\"Back to Leadership\",\"memberType\":{\"leadership\":\"Leadership\",\"author\":\"Author\",\"speaker\":\"Speaker\"},\"resourcesHeading\":{\"author\":\"Articles\",\"speaker\":\"Resources \u0026 Appearances\"},\"moreLeadership\":\"More Leadership\",\"defaultTitle\":\"Abnormal Security\",\"leadership\":{\"evan-reiser\":\"Founder \u0026 CEO\",\"sanjay-jeyakumar\":\"Co-Founder\",\"abhi-bagri\":\"Chief Technology Officer\",\"lisa-banks\":\"Chief Financial Officer\",\"kevin-moore\":\"Chief Revenue Officer\",\"mike-britton\":\"Chief Information Officer\",\"john-slavitt\":\"Chief Legal Officer\",\"lisa-wallace\":\"Chief People \u0026 Transformation Officer\",\"jake-yount\":\"SVP of Global Enterprise Sales\",\"kevin-wang\":\"SVP of Engineering\",\"noah-rolff\":\"VP of Customer Success\",\"keith-mokris\":\"VP of Product and Content Marketing\",\"ryan-patel-francis\":\"VP of Revenue Marketing\",\"stephen-harrison\":\"VP of Product, New Products\"},\"resources\":{\"evan-reiser\":{\"aiThreatLandscape\":{\"title\":\"The AI Threat Landscape in 2026\",\"description\":\"How generative AI is reshaping cybercrime\"},\"behavioralAiFuture\":{\"title\":\"Why Behavioral AI Is the Future of Email Security\",\"description\":\"Keynote at RSA Conference\"},\"aiNativeCompany\":{\"title\":\"Building an AI-Native Company\",\"description\":\"Lessons from scaling Abnormal\"}}}},\"aboutWhatWeAre\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"What We Are | Abnormal AI\",\"description\":\"Abnormal AI is an AI company dedicated to cybersecurity. We protect email, identity, and AI with behavioral AI.\"},\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"What We Are\",\"headline\":\"An AI Company Dedicated to Cybersecurity\",\"body\":\"AI has been at the core of our products since day one. We apply that expertise to protecting email, identity, and AI, and use AI throughout our own business to move faster for customers.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\",\"ctaSecondary\":\"Explore the Platform\"},\"blades\":{\"blade1\":{\"title\":\"Operationalizing AI Across Every Function\",\"body1\":\"We are accelerating our business by embedding AI into every function. We are pursuing operational efficiencies by automating routine tasks with custom AI agents in finance and HR, and enhancing customer relationships with intelligent insights and accelerating pipeline development and closing.\"},\"blade2\":{\"title\":\"AI-Powered Product Development\",\"body1\":\"While many organizations are using AI code generation to speed up development, Abnormal has taken it several steps further by AI-operationalizing the entire product development lifecycle. This includes AI-driven customer feedback analysis, automated discovery of product enhancements, AI-generated UI and product design, as well as AI-based code generation and testing.\",\"body2\":\"By embedding AI into every stage, we eliminate bottlenecks caused by traditional, manual, and error-prone product development processes. As a result, Abnormal can now deliver complex features and full AI applications in weeks instead of months — enabling us to rapidly expand our behavioral AI platform for customers with new products in a dramatically condensed time frame.\"},\"blade3\":{\"title\":\"Use AI in our Products to Protect Customers\",\"body1\":\"We leverage our behavioral AI to autonomously detect subtle anomalies (attacks) and neutralize them at machine speed without requiring any human intervention. This is important because emerging AI machine-speed attacks require autonomous machine-speed defenses that require no human intervention.\"}},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"Developing AI Experts at Every Job\",\"body\":\"We are scaffolding our employees to become enhanced, superhuman experts in their fields, focusing on directing AI to drive better business outcomes.\",\"label\":\"Careers for Humans\"}},\"aboutWhatWeDo\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"What We Do | Abnormal AI\",\"description\":\"The Abnormal Behavior Platform learns how people, AI agents, and cloud identities behave to detect threats across email, identity, and AI and help organizations adopt AI securely.\"},\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"What We Do\",\"headline\":\"We Build AI Software to Stop Crime That Humans Miss\",\"body\":\"The Abnormal Behavior Platform learns how people, AI agents, and cloud identities behave to detect threats across email, identity, and AI and help organizations adopt AI securely.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\",\"ctaSecondary\":\"Explore the Platform\"},\"blades\":{\"blade1\":{\"title\":\"It's Always Been Easier to Trick a Human Than a Machine\",\"body1\":\"Humans have always been the weakest link in cybersecurity because they are accessible and vulnerable. AI magnifies this risk exponentially, as petty criminals now have access to the sophistication and precision once reserved for nation-state actors. Attacks that once took hours to craft are now created in seconds.\"},\"blade2\":{\"title\":\"Malicious AI Enables Powerful Social Engineering\",\"body1\":\"With information generated by LLMs trained on the superset of all available information on the Internet, the richness and sophistication of socially-engineered attacks is greater than ever. AI-powered attacks have risen sharply due to open-source tools like ChatGPT and its malicious counterparts.\",\"body2\":\"With AI, an attacker can craft the perfect message because AI understands how businesses work, can make very accurate guesses about business operations, and can easily personalize communication for each target.\"},\"blade3\":{\"title\":\"Behavioral AI is Required to Protect Humans\",\"body1\":\"Abnormal is ushering in a new era of cybercrime defense with behavioral AI that autonomously protects humans. The Abnormal Behavior Platform detects subtle anomalies that deviate from the known baseline — protecting humans from the full gamut of never-before-seen attacks.\"}},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"Stop the Attacks That Target Your People\",\"body\":\"See how Abnormal's behavioral AI detects the social engineering and account takeovers that legacy defenses miss.\",\"label\":\"Request a Demo\"}},\"aboutWhereWeAreGoing\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Where We're Going | Abnormal AI\",\"description\":\"Our vision is to help organizations adopt AI with confidence, with behavioral security that understands people, agents, and cloud activity, and responds at machine speed within the policies their teams set.\"},\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Where We're Going\",\"headline\":\"Autonomous Defense for the AI Era\",\"body\":\"Our vision is to help organizations adopt AI with confidence, with behavioral security that understands people, agents, and cloud activity, and responds at machine speed within the policies their teams set.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\",\"ctaSecondary\":\"Explore the Platform\"},\"blades\":{\"blade1\":{\"title\":\"AI-Powered Product Development\",\"body1\":\"While many organizations are using AI code generation to speed up development, Abnormal has taken it several steps further by AI-operationalizing the entire product development lifecycle. This includes AI-driven customer feedback analysis, automated discovery of product enhancements, AI-generated UI and product design, as well as AI-based code generation and testing.\",\"body2\":\"By embedding AI into every stage, we eliminate bottlenecks caused by traditional, manual, and error-prone product development processes. As a result, Abnormal can now deliver complex features and full AI applications in weeks instead of months — enabling us to rapidly expand our behavioral AI platform for customers with new products in a dramatically condensed time frame.\"},\"blade2\":{\"title\":\"Understanding Humans Better Than Humans\",\"body1\":\"Abnormal is the most advanced platform for understanding human behavior. By integrating with a broad range of data sources, Abnormal learns the behavior of every entity — employee, vendor, and beyond — to build dynamic behavioral baselines. It continuously analyzes how identities interact, uncovering the context and patterns within those relationships.\",\"body2\":\"What sets Abnormal apart from conventional cybersecurity and behavioral platforms is its ability to assess the risk of every event by correlating deep behavioral identity insights with tens of thousands of context signals. This multi-dimensional approach enables Abnormal to detect subtle anomalies and autonomously identify and neutralize low-signal, high-impact threats — like business email compromise (BEC), vendor fraud, and insider threats — that traditional systems often miss.\"},\"blade3\":{\"title\":\"Extending the Behavioral AI Platform Across a Broad Range of Use Cases\",\"body1\":\"We are extending the behavioral AI behind our email and identity protection through five AI Security products: AI Governance, AI Cloud Security, AI Employee Guardrails, AI Agent Security, and AI Security Workbench. Together, they address AI adoption, employee and agent behavior, cloud threats, and security investigations. Availability varies by product as we develop and expand access with customers.\"},\"blade4\":{\"title\":\"Autonomously Neutralizing Machine-Speed AI Attacks With No Human Intervention\",\"body1\":\"Increasingly, a whole new class of AI attacks are executing at machine speed, and no human-powered loop system will be sufficient to detect and neutralize them. These machine-speed AI attacks require defenses that autonomously detect and neutralize attacks at machine speed with no human intervention. The Abnormal Behavioral Platform is protecting thousands of organizations today by autonomously detecting and neutralizing AI attacks at machine speed with no human intervention required.\"},\"blade5\":{\"title\":\"Filling the Cybersecurity Market Skills Gap\",\"body1\":\"With the demand for skilled security professionals outpacing the number of people available, Abnormal is committed to filling the gap by automating Tier 1 triage, investigation, and response functions — allowing security teams to focus on the highest-priority and most complex threats.\",\"body2\":\"By leveraging AI to autonomously detect, analyze, and respond to advanced threats — ultimately eliminating the need for manual intervention in routine SOC operations — Abnormal is enabling organizations to scale security without additional headcount. This AI automation will help reduce the cybersecurity talent shortage, increase efficiency, accelerate threat response, and fortify defenses while reducing operational burden.\"}},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"See Where Autonomous AI Security Takes You\",\"body\":\"Get a personalized look at how Abnormal's behavioral AI protects your people, platforms, and business.\",\"label\":\"Request a Demo\"}},\"aboutWhatCustomersBelieve\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"What Customers Believe | Abnormal AI\",\"description\":\"Why the world's most security-conscious organizations trust Abnormal's AI — security, dependable decisioning, transparency, global scale, and accountability.\"},\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"What Customers Believe\",\"headline\":\"The Most Dependable and Trustworthy AI\",\"body\":\"Abnormal is in a class of its own with its highly-developed and trusted AI platform. With access to organizations' most sensitive data, it autonomously makes billions of business-critical decisions without human intervention.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\",\"ctaSecondary\":\"Explore the Platform\"},\"blades\":{\"blade1\":{\"title\":\"Highest Standards for Security, Privacy, and Compliance\",\"description\":\"At Abnormal, security isn't a feature — it's our foundation. We're committed to upholding the highest standards in everything we build and deliver. Our platform uses a defense-in-depth approach, protecting your data at every layer from ingestion to storage. We don't just check compliance boxes for SOC 2, ISO 27001, and GDPR — we exceed what the world's most security-conscious organizations expect. We protect your environment while respecting your data, users, and trust.\"},\"blade2\":{\"title\":\"AI Decisioning That's Truly Dependable\",\"description\":\"Abnormal AI delivers superhuman judgment at superhuman speed. Our AI goes beyond automation to make decisions with accuracy, consistency, and context-awareness that outperforms even expert human analysts. Our models continuously adapt to emerging threats, ensuring reliable real-time decisions without the lag or fatigue of manual review.\"},\"blade3\":{\"title\":\"AI Transparency That Empowers Your Team\",\"description\":\"We believe in transparency, not black boxes. Every AI decision comes with a clear, human-readable explanation. Whether we're flagging a sophisticated phishing attempt or identifying unusual account behavior, you'll understand exactly why we made each call — empowering your security teams to act with confidence.\"},\"blade4\":{\"title\":\"Proven Global Experience Everywhere You Operate\",\"description\":\"We operate across borders and industries, protecting some of the world's largest and most complex organizations — from Fortune 500 enterprises to global cloud-native companies. Our platform performs at scale regardless of location, industry, or complexity. Wherever your business operates, we have you covered.\"},\"blade5\":{\"title\":\"Scalable Protection for the Modern Global Enterprise\",\"description\":\"Abnormal was built for scale from day one. Our customers across industries manage millions of employees, endpoints, and messages. We handle massive volumes without compromising on speed, accuracy, or compliance. Whether you're growing rapidly or already operating globally, Abnormal scales with you seamlessly.\"}},\"closing\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Accountability\",\"headlineWhite\":\"We Own Our Mistakes\",\"headlineLime\":\"and Make Them Right\",\"subline\":\"No system is perfect. We won't always get it right the first time — but integrity is non-negotiable, and the CISOs who choose us do so for how we respond when things go wrong.\",\"cards\":{\"card1\":{\"title\":\"Take Responsibility\",\"body\":\"When mistakes happen, we don't hide them — we own them, communicate transparently, and make them right.\"},\"card2\":{\"title\":\"Act Quickly\",\"body\":\"We respond fast, with rigorous post-incident analysis so issues are understood and resolved without delay.\"},\"card3\":{\"title\":\"Learn and Improve\",\"body\":\"Abnormal is built on a culture of continuous improvement — every incident makes the platform stronger. Trust is earned daily.\"}}},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"See Why Security-Conscious Teams Trust Abnormal\",\"body\":\"Get a personalized look at how behavioral AI protects your people, platforms, and business.\",\"label\":\"Request a Demo\"}},\"demo\":{\"hero\":{\"headline\":\"See Abnormal in Action\",\"intro\":\"In your 30-minute personal demo, you'll learn how the Abnormal Behavior Platform:\",\"bullets\":[\"Stops emerging threats others miss\",\"Deploys in 3 clicks, with near-zero setup\",\"Delivers ROI in weeks, not months\"]},\"form\":{\"labels\":{\"workEmail\":\"Work Email\",\"firstName\":\"First Name\",\"lastName\":\"Last Name\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"title\":\"Job Title\",\"phone\":\"Phone\",\"country\":\"Country\",\"stateProvince\":\"State / Province\"},\"placeholders\":{\"workEmail\":\"you@company.com\",\"stateProvince\":\"CA\"},\"selectPlaceholder\":\"Select...\",\"consent\":{\"lead\":\"I would like to receive emails about Abnormal's product updates. By submitting this form you agree to the terms listed in our\",\"linkLabel\":\"privacy policy\",\"tail\":\".\"},\"honeypotLabel\":\"Company website (leave blank)\",\"submit\":\"Request a Demo\",\"errorFallback\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"errorNetwork\":\"Network error. Please try again.\",\"errorEmailFallback\":\"Or email us directly.\",\"errorEmailFormat\":\"Please enter a valid email address.\",\"errorBusinessEmail\":\"Please use a company email address.\",\"errorEmailGeneric\":\"Please use a valid email address.\"},\"confirmation\":{\"headline\":\"Request Received\",\"body\":\"A member of our team will be in touch shortly.\",\"exploreToursLabel\":\"Explore Product Tours\",\"watchDemosLabel\":\"Watch Demo Videos\"},\"socialProof\":[{\"end\":4.8,\"label\":\"rating on Gartner® Peer Insights™\"},{\"end\":99,\"suffix\":\"%\",\"label\":\"would recommend on Gartner® Peer Insights™\"},{\"value\":\"278%\",\"label\":\"Three-year ROI in avoided BEC losses\",\"source\":\"Forrester Total Economic Impact™ Study\"}],\