the Grenadines\",\"ve\":\"Venezuela\",\"vn\":\"Vietnam\",\"vu\":\"Vanuatu\",\"ws\":\"Samoa\",\"ye\":\"Yemen\",\"za\":\"South Africa\",\"zm\":\"Zambia\",\"zw\":\"Zimbabwe\"}},\"platform\":{\"marketecture\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Platform\",\"headlineLine1\":\"Behavioral AI that protects email, identity, and AI.\",\"pillar1Title\":\"Email Security\",\"pillar2Title\":\"Identity Security\",\"pillar3Title\":\"AI Security\",\"poweredByPrefix\":\"Powered by\",\"poweredByName\":\"Attune AI\",\"trustGraphTitle\":\"Identity Trust Graph\",\"trustGraphHumanLabel\":\"Human Identities\",\"trustGraphNonHumanLabel\":\"Non-Human Identities\",\"apiConnectorsTitle\":\"Data Integrations\",\"apiConnectorsSubtitle\":\"Ingest thousands of behavioral signals via API.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Request a Demo\",\"ctaHref\":\"/demo\",\"pillar1Products\":[\"Inbound Email Security\",\"AI Security Mailbox\",\"AI Phishing Coach\",\"Email Productivity\",\"Misdirected Email\",\"Email DLP Rules\"],\"pillar2Products\":[\"Account Takeover Protection\",\"Identity Threat Protection\",\"Infiltration Prevention\",\"Posture Management\"],\"pillar3Products\":[\"AI Governance\",\"AI Cloud Security\",\"AI Employee Guardrails\",\"AI Agent Security\",\"AI Security Workbench\"],\"apiGroupIdentityLabel\":\"Identity\",\"apiGroupCloudOfficeLabel\":\"Cloud Office\",\"apiGroupCloudLabel\":\"Cloud\",\"apiGroupAiPlatformsLabel\":\"AI Platforms\",\"productsLabel\":\"Products\",\"platformTitle\":\"Abnormal Behavior Engine\",\"platformStep1\":\"Learns normal behavior.\",\"platformStep2\":\"Detects the abnormal.\",\"platformStep3\":\"Responds at machine speed.\",\"trustGraphSubtitle\":\"Maps every human, non-human, and cloud identity.\",\"trustGraphCloudLabel\":\"Cloud and Machine Identities\",\"trustGraphCloudEntities\":[\"Virtual Machines\",\"Databases\",\"API Keys\"],\"trustGraphHumanEntities\":[\"Employees\",\"Customers\",\"Vendors\"],\"trustGraphNonHumanEntities\":[\"AI Agents\",\"Service Accounts\",\"Other NHI\"],\"platformStep1Desc\":\"Understand its work, access, and relationships.\",\"platformStep2Desc\":\"Recognize meaningful deviations in context.\",\"platformStep3Desc\":\"Investigate, act, and show the evidence.\",\"pillar1BodyLine1\":\"Stop phishing, fraud,\",\"pillar1BodyLine2\":\"and social engineering.\",\"pillar2BodyLine1\":\"Harden identities, detect compromise,\",\"pillar2BodyLine2\":\"and address insider risk.\",\"pillar3BodyLine1\":\"Govern and control your AI,\",\"pillar3BodyLine2\":\"and protect against rogue AI.\"},\"comingSoon\":\"Coming Soon\",\"attune\":{\"title\":\"Attune 1.0: The behavioral AI model that learns behavior to stop the attacks rules miss.\",\"body\":\"Trained on behavior, not signatures. Sharpened on real attacks. Engineered for behavioral detection.\",\"footnotes\":{\"footnote1\":\"Based on a snapshot of behavioral signals observed in production and used as model training data, with all personally identifiable information removed, captured over a five-month period (August–December 2025).\",\"footnote2\":\"Based on human-reviewed samples from discordant model analysis and system-wide telemetry, comparing the safe-mail false-positive rate of Attune 1.0 against Abnormal's previous-generation model.\",\"footnote3\":\"Based on a one-week, head-to-head comparison of Attune 1.0 against Abnormal's previous-generation model, using discordant-set analysis to identify attacks caught by one model but missed by the other.\",\"refLabel\":\"Footnote {number}\",\"backLabel\":\"Back to reference {number}\"},\"page\":{\"stats\":{\"stat1Value\":\"1 Billion+\",\"stat1Body\":\"derived behavioral signals used for model training\",\"stat2Body\":\"of all malicious attack detections are powered by Attune 1.0\",\"stat3Body\":\"more unique attacks discovered compared to prior model generations per-week\",\"ctaLabel\":\"How Attune Works\"},\"blades\":{\"blade1Title\":\"Built for the Era of Generative AI Attacks\",\"blade1Description\":\"Most security AI evaluates signals independently, missing risk hidden inside normal-looking communication. Attune learns identity, behavior, and content jointly—revealing subtle impersonation, multi-message campaigns, and unfamiliar attack variants that isolated systems overlook.\",\"blade2Title\":\"Efficacy by Default. No Tuning Required.\",\"blade2Description\":\"Attune powers the majority of detections across the Abnormal Platform today. Protection works by default—no custom rules, manual tuning, or prior attack exposure required. As attackers evolve, detection adapts automatically across customers.\",\"blade3Title\":\"Precision You Can Trust\",\"blade3Description\":\"Joint learning across identity, behavior, content, and threat intelligence makes risk clear and consistent. Small deviations in tone, relationships, or workflow become visible—reducing false positives, accelerating investigations, and eliminating guesswork in automated decisions.\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"Attune\",\"subtitle\":\"The behavioral foundation model behind Abnormal's detection advantage, built at foundation-model scale.\",\"ctaPrimary\":\"Request a Demo\"},\"solutionStory\":{\"heading\":\"Detection Built to Understand What's Normal\",\"body\":\"Attackers aren't breaking in; they're blending in. Attune continuously updates its understanding of normal behavior, so new attack variants don't require new rules to catch.\"},\"blog\":{\"eyebrow\":\"From the Blog\",\"title\":\"Abnormal AI Releases Behavioral Foundation Model for Modern Threat Defense\",\"heading\":\"See how Attune brings foundation-model scale to behavioral threat detection across the Abnormal Platform.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read the Blog\"},\"customerVoice\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Customer Voice\",\"heading\":\"What Security Leaders Say\"},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"See Attune in Action\",\"body\":\"Get a personalized demo of the behavioral foundation model behind Abnormal's detection advantage.\"}}},\"whatWeProtect\":{\"microsoft365\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"What We Protect\",\"title\":\"Abnormal for Microsoft 365\",\"subtitle\":\"Your team gets behavioral AI that sees inside your M365 tenant — internal email, Entra ID signals, and tenant configuration — deployed via OAuth in minutes, no MX changes.\",\"cta\":\"Request a Demo\",\"visualPlaceholder\":\"Hero Image / Microsoft 365 Visual\"},\"stats\":{\"stat1Label\":\"Products protecting your M365 tenant from one API connection\",\"stat1Source\":\"Abnormal Platform\",\"stat2Label\":\"Of customers run Abnormal + Microsoft with no third-party SEG\",\"stat2Source\":\"Abnormal Customer Data\",\"stat3Label\":\"Advanced attacks stopped in 90 days at one Fortune 500 customer\",\"stat3Source\":\"Honeywell Customer Story\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Take A Product Tour\"},\"howItWorks\":{\"eyebrow\":\"How It Works\",\"heading\":\"From Connection to Protection in Minutes\",\"learnMore\":\"Learn More\",\"step1Title\":\"Your Tenant Becomes the Signal Source\",\"step1Description\":\"Abnormal connects via OAuth to your M365 environment and ingests email traffic, Entra ID authentication events, tenant configuration, and application permissions. No mail routing changes. No agents to install. Your existing Defender policies stay untouched.\",\"step2Title\":\"Every Identity Gets a Behavioral Baseline\",\"step2Description\":\"The platform builds a profile for every employee and vendor from 45,000+ signals — communication patterns, sign-in locations, MFA methods, device fingerprints, and relationship history. When behavior deviates, Abnormal flags it before damage occurs.\",\"step3Title\":\"Threats Are Removed before Users Engage\",\"step3Description\":\"Malicious emails, compromised accounts, and risky configurations are detected and remediated autonomously. Your SOC team spends fewer than 30 minutes per week in the portal.\"},\"featureTabs\":{\"heading\":\"Comprehensive Protection for Microsoft 365\",\"tab1Label\":\"Inbound Email Threats\",\"tab1Badge\":\"BEC, vendor fraud, credential phishing, malware, and more — caught by behavioral AI\",\"tab1Title\":\"Inbound Email Threats\",\"tab1Description\":\"Abnormal analyzes every inbound message against sender identity, communication history, and content intent. Attacks that pass SPF, DKIM, and DMARC — including zero-payload BEC and invoice fraud — are \",\"tab2Label\":\"Account Takeover and Identity Compromise\",\"tab2Badge\":\"Compromised M365 and Entra ID accounts locked out in under 6 seconds\",\"tab2Title\":\"Account Takeover and Identity Compromise\",\"tab2Description\":\"Abnormal correlates sign-in anomalies, device changes, MFA modifications, mail rule changes, and suspicious email behavior across your M365 and Entra ID environment. When a compromised account starts \",\"tab3Label\":\"Microsoft Teams and Collaboration\",\"tab3Badge\":\"Malicious URLs and attachments in Teams detected and remediated\",\"tab3Title\":\"Microsoft Teams and Collaboration\",\"tab3Description\":\"Abnormal inspects links and files shared in Teams 1:1 chats, group chats, and channel posts. Detections surface in the same unified Threat Log alongside email threats, giving your SOC a single view ac\"},\"customerImpact\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Customer Impact\",\"heading\":\"What Security Leaders Say\"},\"faq\":{\"heading\":\"FAQ\",\"q1Question\":\"Does Abnormal require MX record changes or mail routing modifications?\",\"q1Answer\":\"No. Abnormal connects to M365 via OAuth API. Your mail flow, transport rules, and Defender policies remain exactly as they are. The integration takes minutes, not weeks.\",\"q2Question\":\"What M365 license do I need?\",\"q2Answer\":\"IES works with any M365 plan that supports Microsoft Graph API. Account Takeover Protection requires M365 E3/E5 or Entra ID P1/P2 for sign-in event access. Messaging Security for Teams requires M365 E5. Security Posture Management works with any M365 business or enterprise plan.\",\"q3Question\":\"Can Abnormal see internal emails between employees?\",\"q3Answer\":\"Yes. Because Abnormal connects via API rather than sitting in the mail flow, it monitors internal-to-internal email. This is how it detects lateral phishing from compromised accounts \u0026mdash; a category of attack that gateway-based tools structurally cannot see.\",\"q4Question\":\"Does Abnormal replace Microsoft Defender?\",\"q4Answer\":\"No. Abnormal complements Defender. Microsoft handles known threats \u0026mdash; malware signatures, URL reputation, spam filtering. Abnormal handles the unknown \u0026mdash; zero-payload BEC, vendor impersonation, account takeover, and social engineering that contains no traditional indicators. Approximately 75% of Abnormal customers run this combination without a third-party SEG.\",\"q5Question\":\"What happens if Abnormal misclassifies a legitimate email?\",\"q5Answer\":\"It happens \u0026mdash; rarely. Detection accuracy across enterprise deployments is 99.99% (Honeywell, 188,000 attacks in 90 days). When a false positive does occur, quarantined messages are easy to release from the portal, and Detection 360 lets you submit the case so the model improves.\",\"q6Question\":\"How long before Abnormal starts catching threats?\",\"q6Answer\":\"Abnormal begins analyzing email immediately after OAuth connection. Behavioral baselines strengthen over the first 7-14 days as the platform learns communication patterns, vendor relationships, and identity behavior across your tenant.\"},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"Protect Your Microsoft 365 Tenant\",\"body\":\"See how behavioral AI catches attacks your gateway misses.\"}}},\"platformDashboard\":{\"imageAlt\":\"Abnormal Behavior Platform dashboard\",\"ctaLabel\":\"See Our Platform in Action\"},\"whatsNew\":{\"title\":\"What's New\",\"subhead\":\"Product releases, platform enhancements, and new integrations. Updated continuously as we ship.\",\"latestUpdatesHeading\":\"Daily Updates\",\"updatingResultsLabel\":\"Updating results…\",\"bottomCtaHeadline\":\"See the Platform in Action\",\"eyebrow\":\"Product Updates\",\"latestLaunchesHeading\":\"Recent Launches\",\"allUpdatesTab\":\"All Updates\",\"pillarTabsLabel\":\"Filter updates by area\",\"weekOf\":\"Week of {date}\",\"digestTitle\":\"This Week in Detection\",\"readLaunchBlog\":\"Read the Launch Blog\",\"noPillarUpdates\":\"No updates in this area yet.\",\"types\":{\"launch\":\"Launch\",\"feature\":\"New Feature\",\"improvement\":\"Improvement\",\"integration\":\"Integration\"},\"moreOnBlog\":\"Read More Product Announcements\",\"productFilterAll\":\"All {pillar}\",\"productFilterLabel\":\"Filter updates by product\"},\"connectedEcosystem\":{\"heading\":\"Data Integrations\",\"body\":\"Bring data from your identity, cloud, office, and AI platforms into a shared view. Each supported connection helps Abnormal understand activity, investigate threats, and apply the controls your team authorizes.\",\"cta\":\"Explore Integrations\",\"rows\":{\"identity\":{\"label\":\"Identity \u0026 access\",\"purpose\":\"Who is acting and what they can reach\"},\"cloudOffice\":{\"label\":\"Cloud office\",\"purpose\":\"The work, files, and collaboration around an identity\"},\"cloudInfra\":{\"label\":\"Cloud infrastructure\",\"purpose\":\"Workloads, permissions, and critical assets\"},\"email\":{\"label\":\"Email\",\"purpose\":\"Communication patterns and threats\"},\"secOps\":{\"label\":\"Security operations\",\"purpose\":\"Evidence and response workflows across your stack\"},\"aiPlatforms\":{\"label\":\"AI platforms\",\"purpose\":\"How people put AI to work\"},\"agentPlatforms\":{\"label\":\"Agent platforms\",\"purpose\":\"Where agents run and what they can do\"},\"saasPlatforms\":{\"label\":\"SaaS platforms\",\"purpose\":\"Business apps and workflows across your organization\"}}},\"aiSecurityDashboard\":{\"description\":\"Explore the AI Security dashboard and its connected products\",\"modules\":\"AI Security products\",\"explore\":\"Explore the Product\",\"close\":\"Close protection details\",\"pause\":\"Pause live activity\",\"play\":\"Resume live activity\",\"paused\":\"Paused\",\"signal\":\"Signal detected\",\"context\":\"Behavioral context\",\"response\":\"Protection applied\",\"nav\":{\"governance\":\"Governance\",\"employees\":\"Employees\",\"agents\":\"Agents\",\"cloud\":\"Cloud\",\"workbench\":\"Workbench\",\"email\":\"Email Security\",\"identity\":\"Identity Security\",\"store\":\"App Store\",\"integrations\":\"Integrations\"},\"coverage\":{\"data\":\"Connect employee identity, AI activity, and data context. Block prohibited actions, ask for business context, and record approved exceptions with a clear scope and expiration.\",\"agents\":\"Discover agents, their owners, and their access. Learn normal behavior, recognize unexpected actions, and connect each detection to the agent’s runtime identity.\",\"cloud\":\"Connect behavioral analysis with managed tripwires to detect compromised agents and AI-driven cloud attacks. Investigate activity with identity and cloud context together.\",\"response\":\"Bring detections, identity context, and response evidence into one investigation. Use the workbench to describe new detections in plain English and test them before deployment.\"}},\"workbenchDemos\":{\"discovery\":{\"title\":\"Investigate Activity Across Connected Data Sources\",\"summary\":\"Connect the download and upload to the same employee and device.\"},\"decision\":{\"title\":\"Describe a Behavioral Defense and Test It Against History\",\"summary\":\"Start in shadow mode and review results before enabling response.\"},\"evidence\":{\"title\":\"Use the Same Evidence in Your Team’s Tools\",\"summary\":\"Carry the same investigation across the tools your team uses.\"}}},\"productLifecycle\":{\"statusLabel\":\"Product Status\",\"title\":\"Product lifecycle\",\"currentStage\":\"Current Stage\",\"completed\":\"Completed\",\"upcoming\":\"Upcoming\",\"stages\":{\"discovery\":{\"label\":\"Discovery\",\"description\":\"Early research and prototypes to understand the problem. A product commitment is still under evaluation.\",\"fit\":\"You have a problem to share and want to follow our research.\",\"action\":\"Guide Our Product Roadmap\",\"intent\":\"Updates only\"},\"design-partner\":{\"label\":\"Design Partner\",\"description\":\"Selected customers evaluate the product free for now and give regular feedback to the product team.\",\"fit\":\"You can test against a high-priority use case and meet regularly with the team.\",\"action\":\"Join the Design Partner Waitlist\",\"intent\":\"Design partnership\"},\"priority-customers\":{\"shortLabel\":\"Priority First\",\"label\":\"Priority Customers\",\"description\":\"Available for purchase and production deployment to selected customers, with direct product-team support.\",\"fit\":\"You are ready to integrate within 30 days and purchase within 90 days.\",\"action\":\"Request Priority Access\",\"intent\":\"Priority access\"},\"global-ga\":{\"label\":\"Global GA\",\"description\":\"Available to purchase and deploy today through your sales representative.\",\"fit\":\"You are ready to buy and deploy the product.\",\"action\":\"Talk to Sales\",\"intent\":\"Buy now\"}},\"updates\":\"Get Product Updates\",\"help\":\"What Do These Stages Mean?\",\"seeHow\":\"See How It Works\",\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"How Abnormal Builds Products\",\"headline\":\"See Where Each Product Stands\",\"body\":\"Our four stages show who can use a product, what is available, and how to get involved. Check the stage on each product page to find the right next step.\"},\"stageGuide\":{\"heading\":\"Four Stages of Product Development\",\"expect\":\"What to Expect\",\"fit\":\"A Good Fit If\"},\"expectations\":{\"heading\":\"Know What to Expect Before You Start\",\"scope\":\"The stage applies to the capabilities and use case shown on the product page. We will discuss your environment, integrations, and required scope before you begin.\",\"participation\":\"Design partner participation requires acceptance. You can also request product updates while you wait for the right stage.\"},\"closing\":{\"heading\":\"Find the Product That Fits Your Priorities\",\"body\":\"Explore the AI Security products, check their current stage, and tell us about the problem your team needs to solve.\",\"cta\":\"Explore AI Security\"},\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Product Lifecycle: Design Partners to Global GA | Abnormal AI\",\"description\":\"Understand Abnormal product stages, design partnerships, priority customer deployments, and general availability.\"},\"intake\":{\"requestLabel\":\"Your Request\"}},\"awards\":{\"hero\":{\"headline\":\"Awards \u0026 Recognition\",\"body\":\"Recognized by leading analysts, media, investors, and customers for innovation in AI-powered security and human behavior protection.\"},\"stats\":{\"gartnerValue\":\"4.8/5.0\",\"gartnerLabel\":\"Gartner® Peer Insights™\",\"segValue\":\"100+\",\"segLabel\":\"Industry awards\",\"recommendValue\":\"99%\",\"recommendLabel\":\"of customers would recommend Abnormal\"},\"sections\":{\"market\":\"Market and Customer Recognition\"},\"tagline\":\"Recognized by analysts and media. Rated by customers. Built on behavioral AI that catches what legacy security misses.\",\"cta\":{\"headline\":\"See How This Translates Into Results\",\"body\":\"Awards tell part of the story. Customer outcomes tell the rest.\",\"primary\":\"View Customer Stories\"}},\"partners\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Partners\",\"headline\":\"Build with Abnormal. Win Together.\",\"body\":\"Channel, technology, and MSSP partners delivering behavioral AI security to enterprises worldwide. Resell, integrate, or manage — there is a path built for how you go to market.\",\"primaryCta\":\"Become a Partner\"},\"crowdstrike\":{\"solutionImageAlt\":\"Bi-directional Abnormal + CrowdStrike integration architecture diagram showing email signals flowing to CrowdStrike for account-takeover remediation and endpoint signals flowing back to Abnormal as case context.\"},\"microsoft\":{\"logoAlt\":\"Microsoft + Abnormal\",\"hero\":{\"headline\":\"Providing Defense-in-Depth for Sophisticated Attacks\",\"subheadline\":\"Abnormal complements Microsoft to provide advanced protection against sophisticated threats targeting Outlook and Teams.\",\"cta\":\"Request a Demo\"},\"benefits\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Benefits\",\"heading\":\"Strategic Partnership\",\"cards\":{\"preferredSolution\":{\"title\":\"Microsoft Preferred Solution\",\"body\":\"Abnormal is an IP co-sell incentivized, MACC-eligible, and PRACR-enabled ISV that integrates with and augments native Microsoft security services, including EOP and MDO.\"},\"azureMarketplace\":{\"title\":\"Microsoft Azure Marketplace\",\"body\":\"The Abnormal products are available through Azure Marketplace to simplify and accelerate evaluation, purchase, and implementation. You can purchase Abnormal with your existing Azure commitment.\"},\"misa\":{\"title\":\"Microsoft Intelligent Security Association\",\"body\":\"Abnormal is a member of MISA, the Microsoft Intelligent Security Association. We join experts from across the cybersecurity industry with the shared goal of improving security for our customers.\"},\"aiInnerCircle\":{\"title\":\"AI Inner Circle Partner Program\",\"body\":\"Abnormal is part of Microsoft's AI Inner Circle Partner Program, collaborating closely with Microsoft to advance AI-native security and deliver joint innovation to our shared customers.\"}}},\"howItWorks\":{\"eyebrow\":\"How It Works\",\"heading\":\"AI-Native Protection\"},\"features\":{\"cloudFirst\":{\"title\":\"Cloud-First Approach to Email Security\",\"description\":\"Most organizations have moved from on-premises email to the cloud, resulting in the need for cloud-based security. Abnormal protects Microsoft 365 customers with a precise, scalable, and effective cloud-native email security supplement.\"},\"accountTakeovers\":{\"title\":\"Identifies Account Takeovers\",\"description\":\"Precisely detect identity takeover attempts across Microsoft 365 with behavioral AI that understands every person in the organization and continuously monitors for abnormal activity to stop attacks\"},\"teamsMessages\":{\"title\":\"Protects Your Microsoft Teams Messages\",\"description\":\"Monitor communication across group chats, teams, channels, and direct messages to identify suspicious URLs. Human behavior AI also dynamically monitors global admins and alerts security teams of changes that may indicate a threat.\"}},\"bottomCta\":{\"headline\":\"See How This Translates Into Results\",\"bodyLine1\":\"Awards tell part of the story.\",\"bodyLine2\":\"Customer outcomes tell the rest.\",\"cta\":\"View Customer Stories\"}}},\"solutions\":{\"index\":{\"ctaButton\":\"Request a Demo\"},\"sections\":{\"faqHeadline\":\"FAQ\"},\"solutionPage\":{\"hero\":{\"exploreDemo\":\"Explore interactive demo\",\"threatBlocked\":\"Threat blocked\",\"justNow\":\"Just now\"},\"problem\":{\"heading\":\"Let Abnormal stop threats before they reach your users.\",\"subheading\":\"Free your team from manual investigation.\",\"oldWayTitle\":\"The old way.\",\"oldWayBody\":\"Manual investigation, endless alerts, constant fire drills.\",\"securityAlert\":\"Security alert\",\"manualReviewNeeded\":\"Manual review needed\",\"suspiciousEmail\":\"Suspicious email\",\"pendingInvestigation\":\"Pending investigation\",\"falsePositive\":\"False positive?\",\"needsAnalystReview\":\"Needs analyst review\",\"userReported\":\"User reported\",\"inQueue\":\"In queue (47 ahead)\",\"gatewayMissed\":\"Gateway missed\",\"becDelivered\":\"BEC delivered\",\"alertFatigue\":\"Alert fatigue\",\"abnormalWayTitle\":\"The Abnormal way.\",\"abnormalWayBody\":\"Automatic detection, instant remediation, zero noise.\",\"noUserActionRequired\":\"No user action required\",\"becImpersonation\":\"BEC Impersonation\",\"timeToBlock\":\"Time to block\"},\"howItWorks\":{\"subheading\":\"Built on behavioral AI that understands your organization.\",\"title\":\"Stop attacks before they start.\",\"body\":\"Abnormal builds behavioral baselines for every identity in your organization. We learn communication patterns, detect anomalies, and block threats automatically—no rules required.\",\"identityProtection\":\"Identity Protection\",\"perIdentity\":\"Per identity\",\"automateTitle\":\"Automate threat response at scale.\",\"automateBody\":\"Abnormal automatically remediates threats across all mailboxes—no playbooks or manual intervention required.\",\"executiveImpersonation\":\"Executive impersonation\",\"vendorFraudAttempt\":\"Vendor fraud attempt\",\"credentialPhishing\":\"Credential phishing\",\"answersTitle\":\"Get answers instantly with AI.\",\"answersBody\":\"Ask questions in natural language. Get instant insights on threats, trends, and security posture.\",\"sampleQuery\":\"\\\"Show me all BEC attempts targeting executives this month\\\"\",\"quickQueries\":\"Quick queries:\",\"topAttackVectors\":\"Top attack vectors →\",\"vipThreats\":\"VIP threats →\",\"vendorRisk\":\"Vendor risk →\"},\"visibility\":{\"heading\":\"See everything. Miss nothing.\",\"subheading\":\"Comprehensive visibility across your entire email environment.\",\"explorePlatform\":\"Explore platform\",\"catchTitle\":\"Catch every threat without reviewing every email.\",\"catchBody\":\"Abnormal's AI reviews 100% of your messages, auto-remediates threats, and only flags what needs your attention—with full context and audit trail.\",\"cfoImpersonationAttempt\":\"CFO Impersonation Attempt\",\"policyAgent\":\"Policy Agent\",\"policiesTitle\":\"Set policies that evolve.\",\"policiesBody\":\"Dynamic policies that learn from your organization and adapt to new threats automatically.\",\"threatActivity\":\"Threat Activity\",\"spotRisksTitle\":\"Spot risks before they escalate.\",\"spotRisksBody\":\"Real-time visibility into attack patterns across your entire organization.\",\"askAnything\":\"Ask anything...\",\"topThreatsThisWeek\":\"Top threats this week?\",\"vipTargetingTrends\":\"VIP targeting trends?\",\"vendorRiskScore\":\"Vendor risk score?\",\"instantAnswersTitle\":